==Area-of-effect attacks==
Some [[weapons]], [[spells]] or [[equipment]] are capable of hitting multiple opponents in a single hit. Most of them can still be used in [[single-combat area]]s, but they can only hit multiple opponents while in a multi-combat area. 
===Sources===

Technically, the [[Dwarf multicannon]] is not a multi-hitting weapon; it simply shoots at many opponents very rapidly given that the player is not under attack or is in a multi-combat area.
The [[Soulflame horn]], while not directly an attack, does affect allies within an area. 

